      "problem_summary_title": "Forecasting Nottingham monthly air temperature",
      "problem_summary_body": "This dataset contains 240 monthly average air-temperature observations recorded at Nottingham Castle from 1920 through 1939. Atlas treats the series as a univariate forecasting problem: using the governed monthly history, the model forecasts the next 12 monthly temperatures in degrees Fahrenheit. Evaluation preserves temporal order through expanding-window backtesting and a final 1939 holdout.",
